{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39659752",
      "title": "Forwarding Props To Wrapped Elements",
      "sourceHash": "0d249c8f1a57292509b8a1ba0533b1275518f67b30f7d33ea3a7a33d1d4d2622",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.78,
          "end": 4.02,
          "en": "When destructuring our props like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.02,
          "end": 6.27,
          "en": "we can also add some special",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.27,
          "end": 8.97,
          "en": "built-in JavaScript syntax here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.97,
          "end": 11.94,
          "en": "where we add three dots here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.94,
          "end": 15.06,
          "en": "and then, thereafter, any identifier of our choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.06,
          "end": 18.75,
          "en": "For example, the word props, but this is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.75,
          "end": 23.34,
          "en": "But this three dots thing here is built into JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.34,
          "end": 25.77,
          "en": "and basically tells JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.77,
          "end": 28.23,
          "en": "to collect all other props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.23,
          "end": 31.29,
          "en": "that might be received on this section component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.29,
          "end": 34.92,
          "en": "and merge them into a props object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.92,
          "end": 36.96,
          "en": "So into one JavaScript object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.96,
          "end": 39.48,
          "en": "that can then be used under the name props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.48,
          "end": 40.653,
          "en": "in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.55,
          "end": 44.34,
          "en": "And this allows us to then forward them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.34,
          "end": 48.6,
          "en": "here to this Section element, this built-in Section element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.6,
          "end": 51.99,
          "en": "by using the spread operator, which looks the same,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.99,
          "end": 54.72,
          "en": "but we're using it in a different place here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.72,
          "end": 59.13,
          "en": "Here, we're using it to group some data into an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.13,
          "end": 62.49,
          "en": "Here, we're using it to spread some data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.49,
          "end": 63.993,
          "en": "onto some other element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.95,
          "end": 67.59,
          "en": "And here, we can then use this spread operator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.59,
          "end": 71.67,
          "en": "on this props object or whichever name you chose here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.67,
          "end": 75.873,
          "en": "So these two things here are related, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.8,
          "end": 80.25,
          "en": "And this will now basically ensure that all extra props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.25,
          "end": 83.46000000000001,
          "en": "that might be set on our custom Section component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.46000000000001,
          "end": 88.35,
          "en": "will be forwarded to this built-in Section element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.35,
          "end": 91.5,
          "en": "And this, therefore, then allows us to set the ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.5,
          "end": 93.87,
          "en": "and also a class name, if we want to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.87,
          "end": 95.78999999999999,
          "en": "and whatever else we want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.78999999999999,
          "end": 99.53999999999999,
          "en": "and all those props, which we're not manually extracting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.53999999999999,
          "end": 101.43,
          "en": "like title or children,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.43,
          "end": 103.35,
          "en": "will, therefore, simply all be merged",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.35,
          "end": 104.82,
          "en": "into this props object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.82,
          "end": 107.343,
          "en": "and then spread onto this Section element here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.6,
          "end": 111.12,
          "en": "And this can be a very useful pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.12,
          "end": 113.31,
          "en": "when building wrapper components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.31,
          "end": 115.953,
          "en": "like this Section component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.82,
          "end": 120.03,
          "en": "With that, everything looks the way it did before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.03,
          "end": 122.97,
          "en": "and everything also works the way it did before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.97,
          "end": 126,
          "en": "if I reload this and try these buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126,
          "end": 128.883,
          "en": "But we now got a very flexible wrapper component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.08,
          "end": 132.18,
          "en": "And we could have used the same pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.18,
          "end": 135.33,
          "en": "also for the TabButton, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.33,
          "end": 140.32999999999998,
          "en": "Here, instead of manually getting this onSelect prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.34,
          "end": 143.22,
          "en": "and setting this as a value for the onClick prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.22,
          "end": 144.96,
          "en": "of the built-in button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.96,
          "end": 146.76,
          "en": "we could have also gotten rid of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.84,
          "end": 150.99,
          "en": "And instead, use the same approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.99,
          "end": 153.72,
          "en": "where we merge any leftover props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 153.72,
          "end": 158.72,
          "en": "into this props object with this three dots operator here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.32999999999998,
          "end": 161.88,
          "en": "And then, here, we could simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.88,
          "end": 164.88,
          "en": "spread those remaining props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.88,
          "end": 166.833,
          "en": "like this, onto the built-in button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.35,
          "end": 171.78,
          "en": "And with that, we then just have to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.78,
          "end": 174.32999999999998,
          "en": "that in the place where we're using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.32999999999998,
          "end": 176.31,
          "en": "this TabButton component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.31,
          "end": 179.55,
          "en": "we are now no longer setting the onSelect prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.55,
          "end": 182.25,
          "en": "because that was a custom prop defined by us,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.25,
          "end": 184.2,
          "en": "but instead, the onClick prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.2,
          "end": 187.89,
          "en": "which exists on that button, that built-in button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.89,
          "end": 190.893,
          "en": "to which we're forwarding those leftover props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.54,
          "end": 195.78,
          "en": "So now, here, in Examples, in the Examples component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.78,
          "end": 200.25,
          "en": "we can and should replace all onSelect props with onClick",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 200.25,
          "end": 203.57999999999998,
          "en": "to use that same prop forwarding pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.57999999999998,
          "end": 205.503,
          "en": "on this TabButton component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 206.97,
          "end": 210.42000000000002,
          "en": "And with that, if you save all files and you reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 210.42000000000002,
          "end": 213.15,
          "en": "you'll again see that all those buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 213.15,
          "end": 215.85,
          "en": "still work the same way they did before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.85,
          "end": 219.03,
          "en": "But now, again, using this special pattern,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 219.03,
          "end": 222.84,
          "en": "where we forward props to some inner element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 222.84,
          "end": 224.493,
          "en": "in our custom component.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}